---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-93-economic-development-industrial-strategy-innovation-systems-regional-convergence-productive-transformation-registry.json";
const strategies = registry.economic_development_mission_sector_strategy_production_ecosystem_dossiers;
const innovation = registry.innovation_research_diffusion_commercialization_standards_ledgers;
const regions = registry.regional_cluster_corridor_supplier_workforce_convergence_registers;
const transformation = registry.productive_transformation_diversification_decarbonization_shared_prosperity_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Economic Development, Industrial Strategy, Innovation Systems, Regional Convergence And Productive Transformation | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive mission, production-ecosystem, innovation, regional-convergence, and productive-transformation records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-economic-development-industrial-strategy-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Productive Development</div><h1 class="page-title">Subsidy volume is not additional productive capacity, and output growth is not a just transformation.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 93 traces economic-development missions and sector strategies; production ecosystems and additionality; research, diffusion, commercialization and standards; clusters, corridors, suppliers, workforce and regional convergence; then diversification, decarbonization, resilience, shared prosperity and democratic productive transformation.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive strategy dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive innovation ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive region registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive transformation ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 development decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Missions, Sector Strategies And Production Ecosystems</div><h2>Eight strategy dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/missions-sector-strategies-policy-coherence-001/">Read the missions and strategy guide</a></div><div class="grid">{strategies.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.strategy_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/economic-development-industrial-strategy-productive-transformation/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Missions, sectors, value chains, production capacity, constraints, instruments, conditions, additionality, public returns, distribution, review, and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Innovation, Research, Diffusion, Commercialization And Standards</div><h2>Eight innovation ledgers contain no readiness or adoption decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/technology-diffusion-extension-standards-interoperability-001/">Read the diffusion and standards guide</a></div><div class="grid">{innovation.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.innovation_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/economic-development-industrial-strategy-productive-transformation/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.innovation_research_diffusion_commercialization_standards_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Research, demonstration, validation, readiness, intellectual property, standards, transfer, diffusion, commercialization, access, public returns, and outcomes remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Regional Clusters, Corridors, Suppliers, Workforce And Convergence</div><h2>Eight regional-development registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/clusters-corridors-regional-innovation-local-governance-001/">Read the regional-development guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{regions.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/economic-development-industrial-strategy-productive-transformation/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.regional_cluster_corridor_supplier_workforce_convergence_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Places, clusters, suppliers, workforce, infrastructure, development finance, anchor demand, ownership, reinvestment, displacement, convergence, distribution, and resilience remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.region_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Diversification, Decarbonization, Resilience And Shared Prosperity</div><h2>Eight transformation ledgers contain no productive-transformation decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/diversification-decarbonization-resilience-productive-upgrading-001/">Read the productive-upgrading guide</a></div><div class="grid">{transformation.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/economic-development-industrial-strategy-productive-transformation/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.productive_transformation_diversification_decarbonization_shared_prosperity_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Capabilities, productivity, quality, domestic value, diversification, decarbonization, circularity, worker adjustment, community outcomes, regional convergence, resilience, shared prosperity, and legitimacy remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.transformation_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty productive-development state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating subsidies as capacity, attraction as rooted development, patents as diffusion, export complexity as shared prosperity, infrastructure spending as an executable ecosystem, or output growth as just transformation—and without selecting, subsidizing, procuring, validating, licensing, standardizing, clustering, allocating, transitioning, scoring, ranking, or changing a stage.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/economic-development-industrial-strategy-innovation-systems-regional-convergence-productive-transformation.json">Economic development and productive transformation JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
